    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59626" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κράν-ειᾰ</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], ἡ, </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κράνον</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cornelian
				cherry, Cornus mas</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τανύφλοιος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.767
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁψάμενον βρόχον αἰπὺν ἀφ᾽ ὑψήλοιο κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Demetr.
				</span></i>
			 Troez. <i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρπὸς κρανείης</span>, as food
			for swine, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				10.242
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσχυρότατον ἡ κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					5.6.4
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόξον κρανείας</span>
			<i>of cherry-wood</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				785
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥάβδος κρανείας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					1.23
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				12.43
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρανείας τάλαντον</span>”
				<i>of cornel-wood,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					IG
					11(2).161
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				104
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κράνεια</span> alone, =
			<i>spear,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				6.123
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Anyte</span>): —also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρᾰνία</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mochl.</u>
				42
			</span></i> (gen. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίης</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.119
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.41
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>An.</u>
				2.3.7
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρᾰνέα</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				10.87.4
			</span></i>.</div>
